WEBVTT

00:00:21.110 --> 00:00:22.660
Phantom pains.

00:00:23.290 --> 00:00:26.020
My arm may be gone, but I can still feel it hurting.

00:00:26.710 --> 00:00:31.300
It's a sign that something bad's going to happen today.

00:00:36.010 --> 00:00:38.760
It's never wrong.

00:00:46.850 --> 00:00:50.460
Suomi! We have to evacuate the students and prepare to counterattack!

00:00:50.460 --> 00:00:50.980
Right!

00:00:58.390 --> 00:01:00.340
Nothing but boring smells!

00:01:00.830 --> 00:01:05.370
None of you are the smell I want to destroy!

00:01:15.340 --> 00:01:16.640
It's him!

00:01:17.340 --> 00:01:18.760
Watch out!

00:01:22.250 --> 00:01:24.260
I didn't want to believe it...

00:01:24.260 --> 00:01:28.760
Jin, you're one of them...

00:01:28.760 --> 00:01:29.580
What?

00:01:30.370 --> 00:01:33.080
I'm sorry. I overheard...

00:01:33.910 --> 00:01:35.400
a message for you.

00:01:37.110 --> 00:01:39.060
What are you two doing?

00:01:39.530 --> 00:01:41.000
Hurry and get to the shelter!

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:42.160
Mix! Are you okay?

00:01:42.160 --> 00:01:43.060
Andy!

00:01:50.040 --> 00:01:50.980
Mix!

00:01:52.630 --> 00:01:54.960
No!

00:01:54.960 --> 00:01:55.940
Yunoha!

00:03:28.410 --> 00:03:31.260
The Mithra Gnis is destroying our autocannons!

00:03:31.260 --> 00:03:33.230
72% of them have been destroyed!

00:03:33.630 --> 00:03:36.740
Most of the students have been safely evacuated,

00:03:36.740 --> 00:03:40.740
but there are over twenty still unaccounted for.

00:03:40.740 --> 00:03:41.860
Damn!

00:03:42.290 --> 00:03:45.370
Launch gate standing by! Launch gate standing by!

00:03:45.790 --> 00:03:48.620
There's no mistaking that Abductor.

00:03:49.410 --> 00:03:50.580
The pilot...

00:03:51.050 --> 00:03:52.000
Mikono!

00:03:53.130 --> 00:03:58.000
I swear I'll protect you, no matter what happens out there.

00:03:58.770 --> 00:03:59.550
Amata!

00:04:01.190 --> 00:04:03.800
Thank you. I believe in you.

00:04:04.390 --> 00:04:05.140
Mikono...

00:04:06.640 --> 00:04:10.720
You guys remember that love is forbidden, right?

00:04:11.390 --> 00:04:12.620
Here we go!

00:04:12.620 --> 00:04:13.520
Roger!

00:04:17.310 --> 00:04:19.720
We have to stop him from destroying our base!

00:04:19.720 --> 00:04:21.020
Counterattack Union!

00:04:21.020 --> 00:04:21.800
Go!

00:04:21.800 --> 00:04:23.150
Aquarion!

00:04:28.670 --> 00:04:31.020
Aquarion Evol!

00:04:37.610 --> 00:04:38.840
There's the smell.

00:04:39.390 --> 00:04:41.760
Finally, you've come... my...

00:04:42.770 --> 00:04:43.760
My...

00:04:44.470 --> 00:04:46.090
Silvie!

00:04:52.170 --> 00:04:53.620
He's in our communication line!

00:04:53.620 --> 00:04:55.690
Did he say Silvie?

00:04:56.970 --> 00:04:59.690
Why does my chest hurt?

00:05:08.820 --> 00:05:11.910
Infinity Punch!

00:05:11.910 --> 00:05:13.660
Nice try!

00:05:20.590 --> 00:05:22.160
The Infinity Punch!

00:05:22.160 --> 00:05:23.590
He turned it back on them!

00:05:24.090 --> 00:05:25.160
What the...

00:05:27.430 --> 00:05:30.850
Detecting high aura levels from the Mithra Gnis!

00:05:30.850 --> 00:05:34.000
Are those Element signs?

00:05:34.000 --> 00:05:37.320
Are you saying the Abductor is an Element?

00:05:37.320 --> 00:05:38.100
Impossible!

00:05:39.050 --> 00:05:40.860
The power of reversal.

00:05:40.860 --> 00:05:41.980
Reversal?

00:05:41.980 --> 00:05:44.900
As his love turns into hate,

00:05:44.900 --> 00:05:50.580
flames freeze into ice, and light is swallowed by dark.

00:05:51.510 --> 00:05:54.330
You mean that he can reverse the laws of physics...

00:06:04.070 --> 00:06:04.980
There.

00:06:05.650 --> 00:06:07.260
Jin?

00:06:07.770 --> 00:06:09.040
You're awake.

00:06:09.970 --> 00:06:11.000
Where are we?

00:06:11.830 --> 00:06:13.760
You're coming with me.

00:06:14.690 --> 00:06:16.370
To the planet of Altair.

00:06:16.370 --> 00:06:19.020
The world where I live.

00:06:20.750 --> 00:06:21.770
Jin?

00:06:26.610 --> 00:06:29.370
I can't. We can't go.

00:06:29.370 --> 00:06:31.260
They're out there fighting.

00:06:31.260 --> 00:06:33.870
Our friends, the ones who accepted us.

00:06:34.830 --> 00:06:37.880
Too bad. I need you.

00:06:37.880 --> 00:06:38.620
But...

00:06:38.620 --> 00:06:42.000
I planned all of this.

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:45.630
My job is to take the most powerful Rare Igura.

00:06:46.350 --> 00:06:49.160
They'd never accept me if they knew that!

00:06:49.160 --> 00:06:50.640
Let go of me, Jin!

00:06:55.530 --> 00:06:56.770
We have an emergency!

00:06:57.390 --> 00:07:00.650
One of the Vectors in the hangar is trying to make an unauthorized launch!

00:07:00.650 --> 00:07:01.960
What?

00:07:01.960 --> 00:07:02.900
Who's the pilot?

00:07:05.750 --> 00:07:08.820
Akbarjin Batbayar! I knew it!

00:07:08.820 --> 00:07:10.320
He's an enemy spy?

00:07:10.320 --> 00:07:11.780
No way!

00:07:11.780 --> 00:07:12.740
I can't believe it!

00:07:13.770 --> 00:07:16.580
Called it! He had a dark secret!

00:07:16.580 --> 00:07:18.330
I'll go stop him.

00:07:19.250 --> 00:07:20.340
Authorized.

00:07:22.170 --> 00:07:23.600
Zessica! Help me!

00:07:23.600 --> 00:07:24.090
You got it!

00:07:29.190 --> 00:07:30.900
Pathetic!

00:07:40.470 --> 00:07:42.140
What's with this Abductor?

00:07:42.590 --> 00:07:44.660
It's not just that new power of his!

00:07:44.660 --> 00:07:48.320
He's way stronger than the last time we fought...

00:07:49.110 --> 00:07:50.160
What's that?

00:07:51.070 --> 00:07:53.100
Something's coming through the Dimension Gate!

00:07:53.100 --> 00:07:59.080
Highly concentrated energy is being shaped into a tube and funneled into the Mithra Gnis!

00:07:59.080 --> 00:08:01.790
So we have to close the Dimension Gate?

00:08:01.790 --> 00:08:04.640
If only we could cut off that tube...

00:08:04.640 --> 00:08:07.420
The red strand of fate.

00:08:08.090 --> 00:08:09.170
The red strand?

00:08:09.170 --> 00:08:10.670
Of fate?

00:08:10.670 --> 00:08:14.780
Who dares weave such a sorrowful fate...?

00:08:14.780 --> 00:08:16.300
Show yourself!

00:08:19.670 --> 00:08:23.810
So you already found me. I knew you would.

00:08:25.330 --> 00:08:26.620
Flower petals?

00:08:39.030 --> 00:08:40.160
He teleported?

00:08:40.970 --> 00:08:42.330
You!

00:08:47.430 --> 00:08:52.780
Jin... You've become so much happier since you came here.

00:08:54.070 --> 00:08:56.560
Was that just part of your plan, too?

00:08:56.560 --> 00:08:57.500
Shut up!

00:08:58.150 --> 00:09:03.060
But I think you really do need them.

00:09:03.710 --> 00:09:07.480
And they all need you, too.

00:09:11.670 --> 00:09:12.990
That's...

00:09:17.990 --> 00:09:19.410
That's impossible!

00:09:29.470 --> 00:09:30.800
I was too late.

00:09:31.630 --> 00:09:36.630
The last son is alive and has fulfilled his mission.

00:09:36.630 --> 00:09:37.890
Who are you?

00:09:37.890 --> 00:09:39.760
He's so pretty!

00:09:48.020 --> 00:09:50.520
I demand that you stop this right now!

00:09:51.690 --> 00:09:53.860
Donar! Are you okay?

00:09:53.860 --> 00:09:54.990
Donar!

00:09:57.240 --> 00:09:59.780
It's been a very long time.

00:09:59.780 --> 00:10:02.080
Ten thousand and two thousand years, I believe.

00:10:02.710 --> 00:10:06.250
Or was it twenty and four thousand years?

00:10:07.280 --> 00:10:08.320
Fudo?

00:10:09.270 --> 00:10:11.130
At last you show yourself.

00:10:11.130 --> 00:10:16.120
And in such an ugly form, too.

00:10:16.830 --> 00:10:21.640
Where did you leave your real body?

00:10:21.640 --> 00:10:28.640
What the eyes can see is but an enchantment, a delusion chaining one to the past.

00:10:28.640 --> 00:10:33.480
You yourself are still bound to your old form.

00:10:35.290 --> 00:10:38.780
Oh, well. Let us dispense with pleasantries.

00:10:39.510 --> 00:10:43.260
Apollonius' wings, which glow with amber radiance.

00:10:43.260 --> 00:10:48.790
The true Wings of the Sun. Tell me where they are.

00:10:57.690 --> 00:10:59.120
Aquarion!

00:10:59.120 --> 00:11:00.840
Jin, let me down!

00:11:01.950 --> 00:11:03.460
They're in trouble!

00:11:07.490 --> 00:11:10.740
Jin, please...

00:11:16.470 --> 00:11:17.380
Yunoha...

00:11:20.010 --> 00:11:21.020
I...

00:11:34.570 --> 00:11:36.820
That's the smell.

00:11:42.490 --> 00:11:43.680
Reverse!

00:11:53.490 --> 00:11:55.400
Amata...

00:12:00.250 --> 00:12:02.880
Oh, my...

00:12:02.880 --> 00:12:04.530
My Silvie!

00:12:04.530 --> 00:12:05.660
Silvie?

00:12:05.660 --> 00:12:07.160
I hate you!

00:12:07.730 --> 00:12:10.870
I've hated you since the day we met!

00:12:11.470 --> 00:12:13.350
My Silvie!

00:12:13.350 --> 00:12:15.800
No! Let me go!

00:12:15.800 --> 00:12:16.670
Mikono!

00:12:16.990 --> 00:12:20.550
I hate you! I'm going to kill you!

00:12:22.690 --> 00:12:28.020
I'll crush you in my arms forever.

00:12:33.330 --> 00:12:35.300
No! No!

00:12:39.610 --> 00:12:40.440
Asshole!

00:12:49.690 --> 00:12:50.710
Mikono!

00:12:51.870 --> 00:12:55.000
I remember you.

00:12:55.370 --> 00:12:58.500
You're the weird guy with no scent.

00:12:59.650 --> 00:13:01.010
What are you talking about?

00:13:01.010 --> 00:13:05.740
If you don't smell, you don't really exist.

00:13:06.670 --> 00:13:09.260
So I guess you won't mind if I kill you.

00:13:10.750 --> 00:13:12.440
Let's see what happens...

00:13:13.140 --> 00:13:15.940
if I reverse the blood flow in your heart.

00:13:18.770 --> 00:13:22.980
Magnificent. You're out of options.

00:13:23.530 --> 00:13:27.780
Your last hope has vanished into the void.

00:13:29.670 --> 00:13:31.790
Now, tell me.

00:13:32.690 --> 00:13:36.040
The love of twenty and four thousand years.

00:13:36.790 --> 00:13:38.790
The Solar Wings.

00:13:39.370 --> 00:13:41.200
Where are they?

00:13:49.210 --> 00:13:52.140
Oh, yes. I remember now.

00:13:56.270 --> 00:14:00.760
I'm sorry for forgetting about you, Donar Dantes.

00:14:04.690 --> 00:14:06.450
Let's meet again sometime.

00:14:13.070 --> 00:14:17.120
That was a spiritual body made of pure thought.

00:14:17.910 --> 00:14:21.300
Miss Suomi, raise the Element Jammer in the command room.

00:14:21.300 --> 00:14:21.880
Right.

00:14:25.870 --> 00:14:26.630
Please, no...

00:14:26.630 --> 00:14:27.970
Die.

00:14:28.670 --> 00:14:29.380
What?

00:14:31.590 --> 00:14:32.620
Amata!

00:14:33.130 --> 00:14:34.400
Are you all right?

00:14:35.600 --> 00:14:37.680
Andy! Mix!

00:14:39.090 --> 00:14:42.650
I'm glad you're all right!

00:14:42.650 --> 00:14:45.000
What a shock, though.

00:14:45.000 --> 00:14:49.200
I was just trying to dig our way out, and he fell right on top of us.

00:14:49.200 --> 00:14:50.580
Damn you!

00:14:55.310 --> 00:14:57.640
I'll reverse your very life!

00:14:57.640 --> 00:14:59.750
You can try!

00:15:02.930 --> 00:15:04.060
What the...

00:15:06.090 --> 00:15:07.590
Mikono!

00:15:07.590 --> 00:15:08.720
Cayenne!

00:15:09.650 --> 00:15:10.980
And Shrade, too!

00:15:11.930 --> 00:15:14.780
Aquarion, re-Unite immediately!

00:15:14.780 --> 00:15:15.470
Roger!

00:15:15.470 --> 00:15:19.420
We still have to do something about that Dimension Gate!

00:15:19.420 --> 00:15:20.980
My power to isolate!

00:15:23.770 --> 00:15:26.150
I'll use it!

00:15:26.790 --> 00:15:27.650
You traitor!

00:15:28.050 --> 00:15:30.840
Akbarjin Batbayar, you're...

00:15:30.840 --> 00:15:31.700
Wrong!

00:15:32.990 --> 00:15:36.080
My name is Jin Muso!

00:15:36.080 --> 00:15:38.900
What are you gonna do, spy?

00:15:38.900 --> 00:15:40.500
You have to trust him!

00:15:41.290 --> 00:15:44.590
Jin is one of us now!

00:15:45.410 --> 00:15:47.840
He's playing with you, Yunoha!

00:15:48.890 --> 00:15:51.460
You don't have to trust me. I don't care.

00:15:51.460 --> 00:15:58.220
This power to isolate is something I found by coming here.

00:15:58.220 --> 00:16:00.600
And without it, you won't be able to seal Altair's Dimension Gate!

00:16:00.600 --> 00:16:02.100
But...

00:16:02.550 --> 00:16:04.260
Unite with me!

00:16:06.070 --> 00:16:08.600
A love that crosses worlds...

00:16:08.600 --> 00:16:09.480
Mikage!

00:16:13.570 --> 00:16:18.950
The price of treacherous love is steep.

00:16:18.950 --> 00:16:20.500
Stop!

00:16:24.730 --> 00:16:25.620
Yunoha!

00:16:32.770 --> 00:16:36.680
Jin!

00:16:39.190 --> 00:16:40.760
I'm fine.

00:16:40.760 --> 00:16:43.220
It's just a psychic projection. It's not going to kill me.

00:16:43.220 --> 00:16:44.190
Jin!

00:16:45.130 --> 00:16:47.240
Hurry up and Unite!

00:16:51.750 --> 00:16:53.950
Have it your way, Jin! Let's Unite!

00:16:56.810 --> 00:16:58.910
Amata, Mikono! Piano Four Hands Union!

00:16:58.910 --> 00:17:00.040
Go!

00:17:00.040 --> 00:17:01.160
Aquarion!

00:17:01.160 --> 00:17:02.580
Artillery Union!

00:17:02.580 --> 00:17:03.410
Go!

00:17:03.410 --> 00:17:05.170
Aquarion!

00:17:20.140 --> 00:17:21.640
We can really understand each other!

00:17:24.640 --> 00:17:28.150
This is... two sounds in harmony!

00:17:28.150 --> 00:17:30.650
This power rising up from inside me...

00:17:31.150 --> 00:17:32.900
across the border between worlds!

00:17:32.900 --> 00:17:34.440
This is...

00:17:34.440 --> 00:17:36.660
our...

00:17:36.660 --> 00:17:38.410
Union!

00:17:38.410 --> 00:17:41.210
Aquarion Gepard!

00:17:42.350 --> 00:17:45.020
Aquarion Spada!

00:17:51.990 --> 00:17:53.590
Wow!

00:17:54.110 --> 00:17:56.590
That was a beautiful sound, my friend!

00:18:13.790 --> 00:18:15.400
Playtime's over!

00:18:28.930 --> 00:18:30.800
What a powerful tone!

00:18:30.800 --> 00:18:32.340
We can't take this much longer!

00:18:33.390 --> 00:18:34.590
Yunoha!

00:18:35.030 --> 00:18:37.090
The Elements' aura levels are falling!

00:18:37.090 --> 00:18:39.090
Vital signs unstable!

00:18:39.090 --> 00:18:40.720
Their lives are in danger!

00:18:41.590 --> 00:18:42.800
Kagura!

00:18:45.810 --> 00:18:48.420
Jin, you're still bleeding!

00:18:48.420 --> 00:18:49.960
I don't care!

00:18:49.960 --> 00:18:52.560
I never want to see them again!

00:18:56.270 --> 00:18:57.690
Your tears, that is.

00:19:01.830 --> 00:19:02.820
Jin!

00:19:11.870 --> 00:19:12.820
Yunoha!

00:19:13.550 --> 00:19:14.700
We'll do it together.

00:19:20.990 --> 00:19:21.720
Jin.

00:19:22.140 --> 00:19:23.480
Jin...

00:19:23.480 --> 00:19:24.440
Jin!

00:19:25.890 --> 00:19:27.220
Thanks, you guys!

00:19:31.900 --> 00:19:33.520
We're connected!

00:19:38.650 --> 00:19:39.650
What?

00:19:43.750 --> 00:19:45.020
What is that light?

00:19:45.350 --> 00:19:49.410
Infinite energy that crosses the boundary between worlds!

00:19:56.000 --> 00:20:00.670
Incredible! Gepard is creating new weaponry!

00:20:00.670 --> 00:20:02.300
Gepard is evolving!

00:20:02.710 --> 00:20:04.550
This is Jin's...

00:20:04.550 --> 00:20:08.180
We'll pin him down with Spada! Come, my friend!

00:20:08.490 --> 00:20:09.470
Roger!

00:20:29.390 --> 00:20:30.250
Right now...

00:20:30.250 --> 00:20:32.080
We'll seal away...

00:20:32.080 --> 00:20:33.620
that dark power...

00:20:33.620 --> 00:20:36.130
Fire!

00:20:42.290 --> 00:20:43.820
It formed an isolation field!

00:20:45.010 --> 00:20:46.820
Now, Amata, Mikono!

00:20:46.820 --> 00:20:48.000
Got it!

00:20:48.000 --> 00:20:49.260
Play with me!

00:20:49.260 --> 00:20:51.520
The <i>interruzione</i> in his song!

00:21:01.090 --> 00:21:03.240
Reverse!

00:21:08.690 --> 00:21:09.660
Mikono!

00:21:25.380 --> 00:21:27.890
Now! The final <i>refrain</i>!

00:21:29.600 --> 00:21:30.480
What the—?

00:21:41.440 --> 00:21:43.080
The Dimension Gate is shut!

00:21:43.080 --> 00:21:45.450
Both Spada and Gepard are fine!

00:22:01.410 --> 00:22:03.000
We did it, Jin!

00:22:06.790 --> 00:22:07.840
Jin?

00:22:14.070 --> 00:22:14.960
Yunoha.

00:22:16.370 --> 00:22:20.600
When I met you, it felt like a miracle, and it took my breath away.

00:22:22.610 --> 00:22:27.660
When I take your hand, it makes me feel a little bit stronger.

00:22:28.830 --> 00:22:29.700
So please...

00:24:10.430 --> 00:24:12.550
I want to blow away on the spring breeze

00:24:12.950 --> 00:24:14.840
and scatter away into the summer night.

00:24:16.220 --> 00:24:18.850
I see your face in the autumn moon,

00:24:18.850 --> 00:24:20.880
but then it's hidden by the winter snow.

00:24:22.060 --> 00:24:24.040
The seasons without you...
